# ROVEXO Camera Search v1.0 — MASTER FREEZE

**STATUS: OWNER APPROVED | ABSOLUTE AUTHORITY**

SSOT: `lib/search/camera-search-v1-freeze.ts`

## Flow

```
CAMERA → Take/Upload → CENTER CROP → CONFIRM → AUTO SEARCH
→ Validating image (0.3s)
→ Matching products (0.3s)
→ Finding similar items (0.3s)
→ Preparing results (0.3s)
→ setResults → router.replace(/search/image/results) → DONE
```

## Code rule

ONE request + `Promise.all([findExactProducts, findSimilarProducts, findRelevantCategories, findRelevantFilters])`

Forbidden: sequential awaits · `router.refresh()` · `location.reload()` · `window.reload()` · `setTimeout(5000)` · second Search · empty page

## Navigation

`router.replace("/search/image/results")` only — never push+refresh.

## Copy

`No exact match found. Showing relevant marketplace results.`

## Performance

95% &lt;2s · 98% &lt;3s · 100% &lt;5s · NEVER 10–20s
